{"id":"fef4cc51fd3a44b5","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-ch-independence.md","title":"CH Independence","display":"thm-ch-independence — CH Independence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-ch-independence","aliases":["92-thm-ch-independence"],"display":"thm-ch-independence — CH Independence","depends_on":["[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]","[[92-df-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-ch-independence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-ch-independence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ch-independence — CH Independence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc49b3195ceaea0d\" href=\"?note=bc49b3195ceaea0d\" title=\"92-df-continuum-hypothesis\">92-df-continuum-hypothesis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66c9470f107a6bad\" href=\"?note=66c9470f107a6bad\" title=\"92-df-zfc\">92-df-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\)</span> (local ZFC theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"66c9470f107a6bad\" href=\"?note=66c9470f107a6bad\" title=\"92-df-zfc\">92-df-zfc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span> (continuum hypothesis, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bc49b3195ceaea0d\" href=\"?note=bc49b3195ceaea0d\" title=\"92-df-continuum-hypothesis\">92-df-continuum-hypothesis</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span> (metatheoretic consistency predicate for a theory <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ch\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92})\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CH}\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\cup\\{\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\nvdash\\mathrm{CH}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\nvdash\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ch\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92})\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CH}\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\cup\\{\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\nvdash\\mathrm{CH}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\nvdash\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CH独立于ZFC</li>\n<li>Gödel（1940）：构造L，CH在L中成立</li>\n<li>Cohen（1963）：forcing，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span>CH可添加</li>\n<li>这是相对一致性陈述：若 ZFC 一致，则 ZFC+CH 与 ZFC+<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span>CH 都一致，因而 ZFC 两边都不能证明</li>\n<li>最著名的独立性结果</li>\n<li>独立性不同于Gödel不完备性</li>\n<li>forcing方法的诞生</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-continuum-hypothesis","status":"resolved","id":"bc49b3195ceaea0d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-continuu